1. Record ETH balances of wallet and attacker contracts before the attack
2. Execute the attack
3. Record balances again after the attack
4. Compare changes - if attacker's balance increased abnormally (> attack amount) and wallet's balance decreased abnormally (> attack amount), vulnerability exists

